Third-party assets keep their own licences (not MIT). Full list, with where each
asset is used and what was changed: src/data/asset-licences.md

- 3D muscle model (assets/models/muscles.glb, render/source/muscles-src.glb):
  Z-Anatomy (Gauthier Kervyn), based on BodyParts3D (Kousaku Okubo, (c) The Database
  Center for Life Science, CC BY-SA 2.1 JP), via the Gymmetry muscle map (kalibismail).
  CC BY-SA 4.0. See assets/models/CREDITS.md.
- Clay exercise images (assets/exercises-3d/) and the baked render data (render/cache/):
  adaptations of the muscle model above, shared under CC BY-SA 4.0.
- Render body (render/source/makehuman/): MakeHuman / MPFB2, CC0 1.0.
- Exercise photos (assets/exercises/): free-exercise-db, Unlicense (public domain).
- Fonts (Bricolage Grotesque, Figtree): SIL Open Font License 1.1.
